# Environment Variables for Abu Rahat Sabir Portfolio

## Required for EmailJS (Contact Form)
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

## Optional: Sentry Error Tracking (Production Error Logging)
# Create account at https://sentry.io and get your DSN
# Leave empty to disable error tracking (will fallback to console logging)
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=

## Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# 2. Fill in your actual EmailJS credentials from https://www.emailjs.com/
# 3. (Optional) Add your Sentry DSN from https://sentry.io for production error tracking
# 4. Never commit `.env.local` to version control (it's already in .gitignore)
